---
pageable: true
title: Blog
---

h1 Blog
p.blog-intro
  | Release notes and news from the Padrino team. Follow along with the
  =< link_to 'RSS feed', '/blog.rss'
  | .

= partial '/_partials/blog_card', collection: page_articles

- if prev_page || next_page
  nav.pager aria-label="Blog pages"
    - if prev_page
      = link_to prev_page.url, class: 'pager__link pager__link--prev', rel: 'prev' do
        span.pager__label
          = icon(:chevron_left)
          | Newer
        span.pager__title Newer posts
    - if next_page
      = link_to next_page.url, class: 'pager__link pager__link--next', rel: 'next' do
        span.pager__label
          | Older
          = icon(:chevron_right)
        span.pager__title Older posts
